The journey of R.A Parikh Jewellers began with a small outlet in Billimora which had only traditional Jewellery’s. After the success of this store, we launched a huge showroom with traditional as well as trendy designs, a preferred choice for Indian Ethnic fashion and sets new standards of customer delight every day.

We have designs to suite every mood, budget and occasions as per your desire. We have collections in large varieties to choose from such as necklaces, rings, earrings, bracelets, wedding sets, watches and many more for everyday you and special occasions. You can visit our showroom, where our customer service executive will be happy to assist you to choose a design from our wide collection of finejewellery, be it for men, women or for new born babies.

We understand that quality matters the most, to each one of you. Every piece of jewellery is crafted with utmost care and is thoroughly checked and certified by an expert. We are open in our interactions with our customers. Our prices and policies are always transparent. So, you can shop with confident and convenience.